import source_queries.dl
import ../../dynlex-ui/ui/floating_controls.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI source quick fix
    members:
        document as a pointer to UI source document
        query as a pointer to UI source query
        generation as an integer
        anchor as an integer
        caret as an integer
        available as a boolean
        controls as a pointer to UI floating controls
        control as a pointer to UI floating control

to [cancel automatic UI source fixes in] {a pointer to UI source quick fix:fix}:
    if fix's query != (0 as a pointer to UI source query):
        if fix's query's generation = fix's generation:
            cancel UI source query (fix's query)
    set fix's query to 0 as a pointer to UI source query
    set fix's document to 0 as a pointer to UI source document
    set fix's available to false

to get [automatic UI source fixes] {a pointer to UI source quick fix:fix} [are current]:
    if fix's query = (0 as a pointer to UI source query):
        return false
    return (fix's query's generation = fix's generation) and (fix's query is current for UI source document (fix's document))
